:: RobinTemple Prayer Event
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_done to true>>
<<switch $RobinTemple.prayer_event>>
  <<case 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The visitor has come from Wolf Street. The soup kitchen needs clean bowls before evening. Robin offers to carry a box from the shelves.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        那名访客从狼街来。施粥所在开门前缺一批干净的碗。罗宾提出从架上搬一箱过去。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<templeicon 'quarters'>><<lanLink '帮忙送碗 (0:30)' 'RobinTemple Prayer Bowls'>><<pass 30>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '记下施粥所需要什么' 'RobinTemple Prayer Note'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 2>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The initiate has written the wrong number beside the linen and fears Jordan will think a whole bundle is missing.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        见习教徒说自己在布巾清单上写错了数，担心约旦以为少了一整捆。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '和罗宾一起核对清单 (0:15)' 'RobinTemple Prayer List'>><<pass 15>><</lanLink>><<ggrace>><<gconviction 'Robin'>><br>
    <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '请罗宾先安慰见习教徒' 'RobinTemple Prayer Comfort'>><</lanLink>><<glove>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>><br>
  <<case 3>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The visitor has nowhere quiet to sit tonight. Robin looks toward the quarters, then offers a cup of water first.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        访客说今晚找不到安静的地方坐一会儿。罗宾望向宿舍方向，先端来一杯水。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '帮罗宾去问约旦 (0:15)' 'RobinTemple Prayer Shelter'>><<pass 15>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '留下来陪访客等候' 'RobinTemple Prayer Wait'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 4>>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin flinches at a raised voice behind the door. <<He>> moves closer to you and looks toward the hall. "Could we ask Jordan?" <<he>> whispers.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          门后有人提高了嗓门，罗宾一颤，朝你靠近了一些，又望向大厅。“能去问问约旦吗？”<<he>>小声说。
      <</language>>
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom lte 50>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin says <<he>> heard arguing behind the door. Neither of you knows what happened. <<He>> looks at you. "Should we ask Jordan?"
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾说听见门后有人争执。你们都不知道发生了什么。<<He>>看向你：“要不要问问约旦？”
      <</language>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin says <<he>> heard someone arguing behind the side-room door. Neither of you knows what happened. "We can ask Jordan," <<he>> says, "rather than guessing."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾说听见侧室里有人争执。你们都不知道发生了什么。“可以去问约旦，”<<he>>说，“别只在这里猜。”
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '请约旦说明情况' 'RobinTemple Prayer Ask Jordan'>><</lanLink>><<gdom>><<gconviction 'Robin'>><br>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink '先和罗宾离开' 'RobinTemple Prayer Leave'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</switch>>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Bowls
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 1 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You and Robin wrap the bowls in linen and carry them to the kitchen on Wolf Street. The cook counts them before setting a pot on the stove.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你和罗宾用布巾包好碗，送到狼街的厨房。厨师数过碗，才把锅架上炉灶。
  <</language>>
  <<set $soup_kitchen_known to 1>><<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<grace 2>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<ggrace>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink '回到神殿' 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Note
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 1 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The visitor shows you the kitchen’s address and hours. Robin copies them into <<his>> schoolbook so neither of you has to rely on memory.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      访客告诉你厨房的位置和开放时间。罗宾把它们抄进课本，免得你们全靠记忆。
  <</language>>
  <<set $soup_kitchen_known to 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class='gold'>You learned where to find the soup kitchen.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class='gold'>你得知了施粥所的位置。</span>
  <</language>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer List
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 2 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You count each bundle with Robin. The missing linen is on a shelf in the next room. The initiate corrects the entry while you hold the pages together.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你和罗宾逐捆清点。漏记的布巾就放在隔壁的架子上。你扶住纸页，让见习教徒把数字改好。
  <</language>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<set maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith += 2>><<gconviction 'Robin'>>
  <<grace 1>><<ggrace>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Comfort
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 2 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin sits with the initiate until the mistake can be explained. "We should check the shelves," Robin says. The two of you find the bundle and correct the list together.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾陪见习教徒坐了一会儿，等对方说清错在哪里。“先看看架子吧，”罗宾说。你们找到那捆布巾，一起改好清单。
  <</language>>
  <<set maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith += 3>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Shelter
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 3 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Jordan listens to the visitor and offers a place to rest until morning. Robin fetches water and a clean blanket, then asks whether the visitor needs anything else.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      约旦听完访客的情况，同意让对方留到天亮。罗宾端来水和干净的毯子，又问还有没有别的需要。
  <</language>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<grace 2>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<ggrace>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Wait
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 3 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You stay beside the visitor while Robin speaks to Jordan. When <<he>> returns, <<he>> has a blanket and permission for the visitor to rest in the quarters.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾去找约旦时，你留在访客身边。<<He>>带着毯子回来，也带来了让访客在宿舍休息的许可。
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 1>><<stress -2>><<glove>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Ask Jordan
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 4 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Jordan says an initiate became frightened during a task. "The attendants will see to them," <<nnpc_he 'Jordan'>> says. "The temple looks after its own."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      约旦说，一名见习教徒在做事时受了惊吓。“侍从会照看他们，”<<nnpc_he 'Jordan'>>说，“神殿不会放着不管。”
  <</language>>
  <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin nods without asking anything more. Outside the room, <<he>> asks you to sit with <<him>> for a while.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾点点头，没有再问。出了房间，<<he>>请你陪<<him>>坐一会儿。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom lte 50>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Is the initiate all right?" Robin asks quietly. Jordan says they are resting, and that there is nothing more the two of you can do. Robin looks only a little relieved.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “那名见习教徒还好吗？”罗宾小声问。约旦说对方正在休息，别的事不用你们操心。罗宾只稍微松了口气。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin asks if <<he>> can bring the initiate some water. Jordan nods and tells <<him>> where to go.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾问能不能给那名见习教徒送些水。约旦点头，告诉<<him>>该去哪里。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<set maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith += 2>><<gconviction 'Robin'>>
  <<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<gdom>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Leave
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 4 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You leave the side room behind. Robin walks with you to the hall, then says <<he>> will ask Jordan tomorrow what happened.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你离开侧室门前。罗宾陪你走到大厅，说<<he>>明天会向约旦问清楚。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>
